      "role": "user",
      "content": "Interesting. So, when you say Transcript B is less \"professional,\" are you saying that the actual facts of the story are less believable, or is it more about the way they're speaking? Basically, if the person in Transcript B spoke in a more formal way, would their credibility automatically go up?",
